
# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
#   │       │             │
#   │       │             └─> Imperative, present tense. No period at the end.
#   │       │
#   │       └─> hub|ui|popup|overlay|components|signals|injectors|router|forms|store|
#   │           pipes|http|analog|mcp|extension|vite|demo|deps (or leave it out)
#   │
#   └─> feat|fix|perf|refactor|test|docs|build|ci|revert
#
# Body (required except for docs, 20+ characters): why the change is needed,
# and how the old behavior compares with the new one.
#
# Footer (optional): Fixes #123, BREAKING CHANGE: ..., DEPRECATED: ...
#
# See docs/contributing/commit-message-guidelines.md
